          {
            "id": 2766936,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "I've been looking at ocean biodiversity. That's the diversity of species that live in the world's oceans. About twenty years ago, biologists developed the idea of what they called biodiversity hotspots. These are the areas which have the greatest mixture of species. So one example is Madagascar.",
