                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2767125,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But what he did find was that in all cases, the water at the surface of the ocean had relatively high temperatures even when it was cool at greater depths.",
                "meta": {
