                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2767457,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So a body called the Global Marine Species Assessment is now creating a list of endangered species on land so they consider things like the size of the population, how many members of one species there are in a particular place, and then they look at their distribution in geographical terms.",
